---
// Safe to edit by hand
// The optional site motif on the /studio loading splash
// (src/pages/studio/index.astro, starter PORTS.md card 120). NOT PORTABLE.
//
// MAS Monograms: her Hoop Seal lettering stitched in the Home hero's gilded
// hoop (public/studio-art/hoop.svg, drawn by scripts/gen-studio-art.mjs from
// public/brand/mark-light.svg and src/components/home/HomeHero.astro). The hoop
// IS her mark, so it stands in for the small favicon on this one page: the
// styles below hide the page's favicon picture and lift the hoop above her
// name. They reach only into the splash, which React replaces once the editor
// opens. Decorative (the page's text says what is happening).
---

<img
  class="mas-splash-hoop"
  src="/studio-art/hoop.svg"
  alt=""
  width="196"
  height="214"
  decoding="async"
  fetchpriority="high"
/>

<style is:global>
  [data-studio-splash] .ncs-splash__mark {
    display: none;
  }
  [data-studio-splash] .ncs-splash__motif {
    order: -1;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    width: min(132px, 40vw);
  }
</style>
